      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "取得日本杯、春季天皇赏的胜利；\\n以「绝佳」状态完成秋季天皇赏两连霸；\\n在比赛中战胜黄金船3次以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d1f86bf1350090efd0d844659f4693a1bd29c8e8acc0fa38397ea4df40cc1ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
